====================================
  Hermes OS - x86 Kernel from Scratch
====================================

This is a minimal x86 operating system kernel
built from scratch featuring:

  [BOOT] Multiboot-compliant bootloader
  [GDT]  Protected mode with segmentation
  [IDT]  Interrupt handling (32 IRQs + 16 exceptions)
  [PIC]  Programmable Interrupt Controller
  [TIM]  PIT timer with 100Hz scheduling tick
  [KBD]  PS/2 keyboard driver
  [MMU]  Physical memory manager + paging
  [SCH]  Preemptive round-robin scheduler
  [FS]   Simple in-memory filesystem
  [SH]   Interactive command shell

Commands: help, hello, echo, uptime, ps, ls, cat, mem, reboot

